        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1984_7395.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Hochgeachter edler und wolgeborner herr, E. Ex. seyen
<lb n="2"/>unsere geflißne willige dienst, mit gebürender ehren-
<lb n="3"/>erbietung zuvor, gnediger herr.
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Diewil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ex</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> getrüwe liebe eydtgnossen
<lb n="5"/>und nachbaren herren landtamman und raehte der Jnnern
<lb n="6"/>und Usseren Rhoden deß landts <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-8" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Abbenzell</placeName>, die jaerige
<lb n="7"/>pension, so die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allerchristenlichiste</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">königliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mt</unclear>. unser
<lb n="8"/>allergnedigster herr und pundtsgnoß, ihnen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jaerlich</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allergnedigst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitzutheilen</unclear> verordnet,
<lb n="10"/>ufß fürderlichest abholen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuolassen</unclear>, gnedig
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschriben</unclear>, so haben wir zwar
<lb n="12"/>so importun nit seyn wellen, unseren gsandten,
<lb n="13"/>(wie etwan vor disem mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ex</unclear>. selbs guotheissen
<lb n="14"/>bschehen,) gleich mit abzufertigen, und erheben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zulassen</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">portion</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">höchstgemelter</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>königlicher Mt. höchstlöblicher miltigkeit wir
<lb n="17"/>unß jaerlich haben zuerfröwen, darbey
<lb n="18"/>aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rhatsam</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geachtet</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ex</unclear>. hiemit dienst-
<lb n="19"/>fründtlich zuersuchen, ob wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angeregte</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">portion</unclear>, durch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pottschaft</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürgefallnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gschaeften</unclear> halber, uf vorstehende
<lb n="22"/>tag gen <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgeordnet</unclear>, nit dörfften
<lb n="23"/>abholen lassen, daß verhoffens <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ex</unclear>. werde
<lb n="24"/>ihro solches desto weniger zuwider seyn lassen,
<lb n="25"/>dieweil sie resolviert, sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnverlengt</unclear> an den
<lb n="26"/>königlichen hoff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zubegeben</unclear>, und derowegen die
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußtheilung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvervollkomnen</unclear>
<lb n="28"/>(<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zweifel</unclear>,) bedacht seyn werden. In <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear>-
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wartung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ex</unclear>. bey zeigern diß, gnediger
<lb n="30"/>antwurt, wünschen deroselben, zu ihrer vorhabenden
<lb n="31"/>reiß, von Gott dem allmechtigen, wir vil glückh
<lb n="32"/>und wolfart, gesundtheit und langes leben, und
<lb n="33"/>thund unseren standt, zu dero beharrender gnaden und
<lb n="34"/>gunsten, auch gnediger recomendation gegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jhr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ko</unclear>.
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dienstfründtlich</unclear> und vleissig bevelhen.
<lb n="36"/>Datum den. <origDate when="1626" resp="#ner">26. E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Martij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">A</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">1626</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ex</unclear>.
<lb n="38"/>dienstwillige
<lb n="39"/>B. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rhat</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>.
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochgeachten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">edlen</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolgebornen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear>
<lb n="41"/><persName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Petro</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">de</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Castille</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ko</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-131" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Franckhreich</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Navarren</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geheimen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">raht</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ordenlichem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ambassadoren</unclear>
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">loblicher</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßschafft</unclear></orgName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnedigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear>.
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dieweil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">resolviert</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnverlengt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1984_7396.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">An</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frantzoes</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hr</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ambassadorn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zn</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-49" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Solothurn</unclear></placeName>.
<lb n="46"/><origDate when="1616-03-26" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">26</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Martij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">1616</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Suchen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fremdeschaft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">billichheit</unclear>.
</p>
